       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EXFINAL.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 FINAL-INPUT PIC 9(5)V99.
01 FINAL-STATUS PIC 99.
01 FINAL-OUTPUT PIC 9(5)V99.
01 FINAL-CODE PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING FINAL-INPUT FINAL-STATUS
    FINAL-OUTPUT FINAL-CODE.
FINALIZE-BRANCH.
    MOVE FINAL-STATUS TO FINAL-CODE.
    IF FINAL-STATUS NOT = ZERO
        MOVE ZERO TO FINAL-OUTPUT
    ELSE
        MOVE FINAL-INPUT TO FINAL-OUTPUT
    END-IF.
    GOBACK.
